      "text": "Weekly stacked bars\n\nWeek 1: tactical/social/coach\nWeek 2: tactical/mental/struggle\nWeek 3: recovery/nutrition/fun\n\nDelta labels:\nstruggle +2 vs prior 2 weeks\nfun -1 vs prior 2 weeks",
